    {
      "id": "claim_41f4cd15f4954a9bb217ffd2596f6577",
      "statement": "The statistics UI calls `dbgetinfo` for dates, exercise totals, and angle series, but no definition exists in the repository; consequently chart retrieval semantics and the expected query behavior are unimplemented and a stats-button selection reaches an undefined name.",
