    {
      "id": "claim_82c86f06ad224aa0aecc63106f9b75fb",
      "statement": "User-controlled username strings are interpolated into per-user table-name SQL, and the caller-provided `update_key` is interpolated into the update expression. These identifiers are not safely bound parameters or validated as safe identifiers, despite surrounding some table names with single quotes, so username and column construction are SQL-security and schema-change hazards.",
